# Azure box gate (design/302)

When section sentences do not match the paper and Azure layout is the source:

- Run `python scripts/azure_box_gate.py --fixtures-only` first, then `--pdf <path>`.
- Do not edit `section_flow` while `live_ok` is false.
- Do not print paper text. Inventory JSON has coordinates only.
- `azure_unavailable` means ask for credentials. Do not substitute PyMuPDF.
- design/301 `vision_repair_expected` is not the live sentence order once Azure credentials exist.
